<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Reserve Bank of India">
  <data key="d0">Reserve Bank of India</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Reserve Bank of India is the central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the issue and supply of the Indian rupee and overseeing the banking sector.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulatory body that issues guidelines pertaining to banking practices in India.&lt;SEP&gt;The central banking institution of India that regulates the country's monetary policy and banking.&lt;SEP&gt;The Reserve Bank of India is the central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the issuance and supply of the Indian rupee and overseeing monetary policy.&lt;SEP&gt;The central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the issue and supply of the Indian currency and overseeing the financial system.&lt;SEP&gt;The Reserve Bank of India is the central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the Indian banking system and formulating monetary policy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Reserve Bank of India</data>
</node>
<node id="Senior Citizens">
  <data key="d0">Senior Citizens</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals who are typically above the age of 60 and may receive additional interest rates on deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;Senior citizens are individuals aged over 60 years, recognized for receiving specific services under the doorstep banking scheme.&lt;SEP&gt;A customer segment in banking that includes elderly persons often receiving specialized services or benefits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-mm-table-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Senior Citizens</data>
</node>
<node id="Service Charges">
  <data key="d0">Service Charges</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Fees levied by the bank for various services provided to customers, which are detailed in a leaflet available at branches.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701031</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Service Charges</data>
</node>
<node id="Unity Small Finance Bank Limited">
  <data key="d0">Unity Small Finance Bank Limited</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unity Small Finance Bank Limited is a bank that formulates various deposit products and governs the conduct of bank accounts in accordance with regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Banking Regulation Act, 1949">
  <data key="d0">Banking Regulation Act, 1949</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Banking Regulation Act, 1949 is a legal framework that governs banking operations and protects the interests of depositors in India.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deposit Accounts">
  <data key="d0">Deposit Accounts</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Deposit accounts are financial accounts held at banks or financial institutions for the purpose of holding deposits and earning interest.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Depositors">
  <data key="d0">Depositors</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Depositors are individuals or entities that place their money into deposit accounts at banks with the expectation of earning interest.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bank">
  <data key="d0">Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bank provides various deposit products including Demand Deposits and Time Deposits under different schemes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bank offers various banking products and services to customers, including debit cards, mobile banking, and various account types.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity that accepts deposits and pays interest on them according to specified terms and conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bank refers to a financial institution that offers various banking services, including deposit accounts, loans, and other financial products.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial institution that accepts deposits, offers loans, and provides various services related to term deposits and customer account management.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial institution that provides various banking services, such as account management, loans, and financial advice to customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Demand Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Demand Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A category of deposits that are withdrawable on demand, including Savings Accounts and Current Accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Time Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A category of deposits received for a fixed period, which includes Recurring Deposits, Short Term Deposits, and Fixed Deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Savings Account">
  <data key="d0">Savings Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A form of Demand Deposit subject to restrictions on withdrawals.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of deposit account that allows customers to earn interest on their funds while maintaining access.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basic Savings Bank Deposit Account">
  <data key="d0">Basic Savings Bank Deposit Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A savings account offered as per guidelines set by the RBI.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Current Account">
  <data key="d0">Current Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of demand deposit allowing unlimited withdrawals depending on the account balance.&lt;SEP&gt;A deposit account that allows for numerous transactions and is primarily used by businesses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="KYC">
  <data key="d0">KYC</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Know Your Customer procedures mandated by the Bank to verify the identity of customers opening accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PAN">
  <data key="d0">PAN</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Permanent Account Number required for compliance with KYC norms, especially for non-individual customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cash Credit">
  <data key="d0">Cash Credit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A credit facility provided by banks that allows borrowers to withdraw funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overdraft">
  <data key="d0">Overdraft</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial arrangement that allows an account holder to withdraw more money than what is available in their account.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Debit Card">
  <data key="d0">Debit Card</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial tool issued by the Bank to customers with Savings or Current Accounts, subject to usage charges and internal policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mobile Banking">
  <data key="d0">Mobile Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A banking service provided by the Bank that allows customers to conduct financial transactions via mobile devices.&lt;SEP&gt;A service that allows customers to access banking services via mobile apps.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="WhatsApp Banking">
  <data key="d0">WhatsApp Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A digital banking service offered by the Bank enabling customers to perform transactions and inquiries through WhatsApp.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Internet Banking">
  <data key="d0">Internet Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An online banking platform offered by the Bank for customers to manage their accounts and conduct transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ATM Network">
  <data key="d0">ATM Network</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bank's own network of ATMs and those from other banks available for customer use, facilitated by regulatory adherence.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NEFT">
  <data key="d0">NEFT</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">National Electronic Funds Transfer, an electronic payment system for transferring funds, offered as part of the Bank's services.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RTGS">
  <data key="d0">RTGS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Real-Time Gross Settlement, a real-time payment method provided by the Bank for transferring large amounts securely.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Statement of Account">
  <data key="d0">Statement of Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A monthly report provided by the Bank to account holders detailing transactions and balances.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Minor Account">
  <data key="d0">Minor Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A specialized savings bank account that can be opened in the name of a minor, operated by a guardian.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Joint Account">
  <data key="d0">Joint Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An account held by more than one individual, allowing shared access and management of funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Power of Attorney">
  <data key="d0">Power of Attorney</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A legal authorization allowing one person to act on behalf of another in financial matters regarding bank accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nomination">
  <data key="d0">Nomination</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A facility enabling account holders to designate a beneficiary for their bank accounts, subject to modifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Account Holder">
  <data key="d0">Account Holder</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual who holds an account with the Bank and has the authority to make transactions and withdrawals.&lt;SEP&gt;An account holder refers to individuals who maintain a savings or current account with Unity Bank and are entitled to utilize banking services, including doorstep banking.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Depositor">
  <data key="d0">Depositor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A person who deposits money into a bank account and may nominate a appointee for account management in specific circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who places a term deposit with a bank and is subject to the policies regarding interest and withdrawal of funds.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual or entity that places money into a bank account.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Minor">
  <data key="d0">Minor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A minor refers to an individual under the age of legal majority who may have a bank account nominated through a major appointee.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Appointee">
  <data key="d0">Appointee</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An adult designated by the depositor to manage the funds of a minor nominee's account on their behalf.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Senior Citizen">
  <data key="d0">Senior Citizen</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual over the age of 60 years who may be eligible for higher interest rates on fixed deposits offered by the Bank.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Illiterate Person">
  <data key="d0">Illiterate Person</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual who lacks reading and writing abilities but may still open a deposit account with specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Visually Challenged Person">
  <data key="d0">Visually Challenged Person</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual with visual impairment who can operate a bank account with the help of specific banking facilities and technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Guardian">
  <data key="d0">Guardian</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A designated individual responsible for managing the financial affairs of a person covered under specific welfare acts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transgender Person">
  <data key="d0">Transgender Person</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual who identifies as a gender different from their birth sex and is recognized as a 'Third Gender' in banking processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Persons with Disabilities">
  <data key="d0">Persons with Disabilities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals who may have various disabilities and are covered under acts that provide them the right to access banking services without discrimination.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Resident Individuals">
  <data key="d0">Non-Resident Individuals</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals residing outside their country of citizenship and can hold accounts in accordance with specific regulations by the Bank.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
