  <data key="d2">Legal Guardians must present a Guardianship Certificate to validate their role in managing the affairs of a disabled person.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786700916</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unity Bank">
  <data key="d0">Unity Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unity Bank is a banking institution that provides various financial services, including doorstep banking, to its customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Differently-Abled">
  <data key="d0">Differently-Abled</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Differently-abled individuals refer to those with disabilities who are eligible to receive specific services under the doorstep banking scheme.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Doorstep Banking">
  <data key="d0">Doorstep Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Doorstep banking is a service provided by banks that delivers banking services directly to customers at their residences.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1786701052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="KYC Document">
  <data key="d0">KYC Document</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">KYC (Know Your Customer) documents refer to identity verification papers that customers must submit to banks to open and maintain account balances.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Door-Step Banking for Senior Citizens and Differently-Abled.pdf</data>
