<node id="Cash Pickup">
  <data key="d0">Cash Pickup</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cash pickup is a specific service under doorstep banking that involves the collection of cash from customers for deposit into their accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of banking service where cash is collected from a specified location, as defined in the monetary limits outlined in the table.</data>
