  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of banking service that involves the delivery of cash to a specified location, as outlined in the monetary limits of the table.&lt;SEP&gt;Cash delivery is a service under doorstep banking where cash is delivered to customers through withdrawals from their accounts.</data>
